
form maybe
  case some
    link value
  case none

task wrap-value
  take x, like u64
  send back, make some
    bind value, read x

task get-nothing
  send back, make none

task unwrap-or
  take m, like maybe
  take fallback, like u64
  fork case, read m
    hook some, base value
      send back, read value
    hook none
      send back, read fallback
